Finally, note that the equations $2r_1 + 3r_4 = 0$ and
$2(r_2+r_3) - r_4 = 0$ are also in~$\Lambda^{\vee}$. If~we run the \ref{EGRC} to them at level $-1$, we~still obtain the same conclusion $2e_1 + 3e_3 = 0$ and
